"At Tet, my family will be very busy. Before Tet, we will do the shopping and decorate the house. My grandmother will make banh chung and my mother will make spring rolls. On the first day, I will wear my new clothes and visit my relatives. They will give me lucky money. I love Tet.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,",
