"It is Monday morning. Nam is not at school today. He has a bad toothache and a headache. His mother takes him to the dentist. The dentist says, \"You should not eat too many sweets. You should brush your teeth twice a day.\" Nam should also have a rest and drink warm water. He will go back to school on Wednesday.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,",
"It was Monday morning and Lan did not feel well. She had a headache and a sore throat. Her mother took her temperature. It was 38 degrees, so Lan had a fever. \"You should stay at home and have a rest,\" her mother said. She gave Lan some medicine and a cup of warm water with honey. Lan slept all morning. In the afternoon, she felt a bit better. Her mother said, \"If you drink more water and sleep early tonight, you will be well by Wednesday.\"":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,",
"Yesterday, my friend Nam had a stomachache. He should stay at home and have a rest. He should drink warm water and take some medicine. He should not eat ice cream or sweets. If he feels worse, he should go to the doctor. I hope he will be well soon.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,",
