"The Tortoise and the Hare is a famous story. The main characters are a tortoise and a hare. The hare ran very fast but he was lazy. The tortoise walked slowly but he worked hard. One day, they had a race. The hare stopped and slept under a tree. The tortoise kept walking and he won the race. The story says: \"Slow and steady wins the race.\"":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,",
"The Ant and the Grasshopper is a famous story for children. In the story, the ant worked hard all summer. She carried food to her home. The grasshopper did not work. He played the violin and sang beautifully all day. When winter came, the ground was covered with snow. The grasshopper had no food, so he went to the ant's house. The ant gave him some food, but she said, \"Next summer, you should work hard, too.\" The grasshopper learnt an important lesson.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,",
"My favourite story is The Tortoise and the Hare. The main characters are a tortoise and a hare. The hare ran very fast, but he was lazy. The tortoise walked slowly, but he worked hard. In the end, the tortoise won the race. I learnt that we should never give up.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,",
