"Last weekend, Nam's cousin from Da Nang visited Ha Noi for the first time. He wanted to visit the Ha Noi Opera House and Hoan Kiem Lake. Nam asked, \"How can we get there?\" His mother said, \"The Opera House is quite far, so you should take a bus. Hoan Kiem Lake is near the Opera House, so you can go on foot.\" They took bus number 14 and got off near the Opera House. Then they walked to the lake. In the afternoon, they came home by taxi because they were tired.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,",
