"My family visited Sa Pa last winter. Sa Pa is about 320 kilometres from Ha Noi, so we took a night train and then a bus. The journey was long, but the view was fantastic. The mountains were covered with white clouds, and the air was fresh and peaceful. We visited a small village and met friendly local people. They told us that Fansipan is the highest mountain in Viet Nam. My father took many photos of the town. I think Sa Pa is more beautiful than any other place I have visited.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,",
